            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"美加關係緊張！加拿大一咖啡店將「美式咖啡」改稱「加式咖啡」\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"541\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/70fcd1d836d7bc98f9e34c2e6f83c12ae89c2d5f03aaa238c4299ffc185d0ce9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2Fe396aaec0503f55442366752f8bbb240.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">美加關係緊張！加拿大一咖啡店將「美式咖啡」改稱「加式咖啡」</figcaption></div></figure></div>",
