        },
        {
            "title": "美軍證實轟3艘伊朗油輪！美軍司令威脅加倍報復、哈爾克島遭鎖定",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"美軍證實轟3艘伊朗油輪！美軍司令威脅加倍報復、哈爾克島遭鎖定\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"541\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0c6bf21441544d7c08174d203b751fa454753674ed6a03918847297b2f4028ad/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2Fd89ec956a5cc38da20689cb67a59a963.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">美軍證實轟3艘伊朗油輪！美軍司令威脅加倍報復、哈爾克島遭鎖定</figcaption></div></figure></div>",
